assets/route-seeds.json is derived from src/pool/seeds.json in that project.
Changes by GitHubTurbo (2026-11-08): retained only IP/host route facts;
removed spoofed SNI, alternate verification anchors, mirrors and host policies.
Every imported address is untrusted until a TLS connection verifies the original hostname.

The connection pool, route health, bounded public cache, validated range download,
management UI and tests are new implementations informed by a review of GitPort's design.
No GitPort executable, private keys or user configuration are redistributed.
